error[O-Escapes]: this boundary carries an observation from an owner its signature does not permit
  --> tests/mem/a_handle_escapes_the_body_that_opened_its_arena.lin:13:5
   |
13 |     arena.handle()
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ escape observations only from the signature's declared sources
   |
   = help: `arena` is an allocator `allocator_of_nothing` opens and ends, so nothing built in it may leave: take the allocator as a parameter instead, as `allocator_of_nothing_in` with `A: Allocator` and `allocator: A` first, and build in `allocator`, so the caller's allocator decides how long the result lives
